24
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:26,000
without any of these chaotic activities going on.

25
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Right?

26
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Why?

27
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,000
Why can't human beings,

28
