115
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:42,000
What's the value you're using for comparison?

116
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,000
Which is yourself who are neurotic.

117
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:46,000
Right.

118
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:51,000
So when you are faced with that,

119
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,000
that human beings,

120
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:56,000
who have lived this way,

121
00:04:56,000 --> 00:05:00,000
and have accepted it for millennia

122
