That's what we run into.

154
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:59,000
No, well, no, that's merely a secondary effect.

155
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,000
Secondary, yes.

156
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:03,000
You see, I think that we get to depend on it,

157
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,000
