173
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:35,000
And they're all united.

174
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:38,000
Mm-hm.

175
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:41,000
So, come, why?

176
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,000
Why?

177
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Is it that we have started out on the path

178
